<div class="kdm-body"><fieldset {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}><header class="kdm-header"><p class="kdm-eyebrow">Kingdom Death: Monster · Foundation</p><label>Name <input name="name" value="{{actor.name}}" required></label></header>
<section><h2>Monster record</h2><p class="kdm-hint">Enter privately owned monster data. Zero values are placeholders, not a playable monster profile. Wounds are a manual tally, not hit points.</p><div class="kdm-stats">{{#each stats}}<label>{{key}}<input type="number" step="1" name="system.{{key}}" value="{{value}}"></label>{{/each}}</div></section>
<section class="kdm-placeholder"><h2>AI &amp; Hit Location decks</h2><p>Future milestone: draw, discard, reshuffle, and wound handling. Use Foundry's Cards directory to create private decks. These fields reserve links; no deck actions run yet.</p><label>AI deck UUID<input name="system.decks.ai" value="{{system.decks.ai}}" placeholder="Cards.…"></label><label>Hit Location deck UUID<input name="system.decks.hitLocation" value="{{system.decks.hitLocation}}" placeholder="Cards.…"></label><button type="button" disabled>AI draw — planned</button><button type="button" disabled>Hit location draw — planned</button></section>
<label class="kdm-notes">Game notes (visible to document viewers)<textarea name="system.notes" rows="4">{{system.notes}}</textarea></label><section><h2>Inventory &amp; records</h2><p class="kdm-hint">Drop Items here from the Items directory or a compendium. Edit opens the owned copy. Save changes before adding or editing items.</p><div class="kdm-actions"><button type="button" data-action="addItem" data-type="gear">Add gear</button><button type="button" data-action="addItem" data-type="resource">Add resource</button></div><ul class="kdm-inventory">{{#each inventory}}<li data-item-id="{{id}}"><span>{{name}} <small>{{type}}{{#if (eq type "Resource")}} · {{quantity}}{{/if}}</small></span><button type="button" data-action="editItem" data-item-id="{{id}}">Edit</button><button type="button" data-action="deleteItem" data-item-id="{{id}}">Remove</button></li>{{else}}<li>No items yet.</li>{{/each}}</ul></section></fieldset>{{#if editable}}<footer><button type="submit"><i class="fas fa-save"></i> Save changes</button></footer>{{else}}<p>Read-only. Ask the GM for ownership to edit.</p>{{/if}}</div>